-00001         *///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

 00002         * DOGE Coin CICS/KICKS Application

 00003         * DOGESEND:

 00004         *   Accepts user input for wallet address and amount to send

 00005         *   Sends a record to the output printer D running on port

 00006         *   3506. Uses dogedcams.py to process printer output and send

 00007         *   funds.

 00008         *

 00009         * AUTHOR:

 00010         *   Philip Young aka Soldier of FORTRAN

 00011         *

 00012         * 08/30/2020

 00013         * License GPL v3

 00014         *///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

