 00016          PROGRAM-ID.   DOGESEND.

 00017          AUTHOR. SOLDIER OF FORTRAN.

 00018          INSTALLATION. DOGE BANK.

 00019          DATE-WRITTEN. 08/30/20.

 00020          SECURITY. CONFIDENTIAL.

 00021          ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

 00022          DATA DIVISION.

 00023          WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

