-00511         *

 00512          PROCEDURE DIVISION USING

 00513                  KIKEIB,

 00514                  KIKCOMMAREA.

 00515

 00516         * Set up KIK-V1/V2 as x'01050000' - V1R5M0(0)

 00517              MOVE 17104896 TO KIK-V1.

 00518              MULTIPLY KIK-V1 BY -1 GIVING KIK-V2.

 00519

 00520         * Fill in EIB source trace fields even if not source tracing

 00521              MOVE 'DOGESEND' TO EIBPROG.

 00522              MOVE '23:08:01SEP 24, 2026' TO EIBWC.

 00523              MOVE 0 TO EIBLINE.

 00524

 00525         * Set up initial entry, final return

